@startuml sca-status
' scaStatus — CTX-TXN-AUTHORISATION, INV-AUT-01. PROPOSAL, AI. Source: SRC-IG §14.16.
' The standard lists the codes and their meaning, not every allowed transition; the transitions
' below are the proposal's reading and need review (W-UML-01).
title scaStatus (authorisation sub-resource)

[*] --> received : authorisation created\n(explicitly or implicitly)
[*] --> scaMethodSelected : only one SCA method\n(first status reported, §14.16)
received --> psuIdentified
received --> psuAuthenticated : e.g. access token present
psuIdentified --> psuAuthenticated
psuAuthenticated --> scaMethodSelected
scaMethodSelected --> started
received --> started : redirect / decoupled —\nbank runs the SCA
started --> unconfirmed : SCA done, confirmation\nrequired (Q-34)
started --> finalised
unconfirmed --> finalised : confirmation code accepted
received --> exempted : SCA exemption
started --> failed
unconfirmed --> failed
received --> failed : timeout (Q-29)
finalised --> [*]
failed --> [*]
exempted --> [*]
@enduml
